{
  "name": "dsh-codex-style-worktree",
  "version": "0.5.0",
  "description": "Codex 风格 Worktree：在新会话首行按工作区选择「本地」或「新建本地工作树」（默认），发送第一条消息后自动创建 detached 检出，三步进度通过会话投影实时显示在输入框上方的进度卡里，侧边栏只给托管会话加一个静态图标；不新增 Workspace、不需要命名、分支由 Git 在提交时决定。清理有保护：正被其他活跃会话使用的检出会拒绝删除（可强制覆盖），删除前把 detached 提交存成可恢复的快照 ref（/wt-snapshots、/wt-restore），可选的 cleanupOnArchive 会在会话归档后清理干净且未被使用的检出。所有设置项都能在设置页在线修改并热生效。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "wplct",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "git",
    "worktree",
    "agent",
    "codex",
    "codex-worktree",
    "session-projection",
    "settings",
    "cleanup",
    "restore",
    "snapshot"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.zh.md"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.19.0"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/wplct/dsh-codex-style-worktree.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/wplct/dsh-codex-style-worktree#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/wplct/dsh-codex-style-worktree/issues"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs",
    "smoke": "node scripts/smoke-host.mjs && node scripts/smoke-client.mjs",
    "verify": "npm test && npm run smoke && node --check client/client.js",
    "install:dry": "node install.mjs --dry-run",
    "uninstall:dry": "node uninstall.mjs --dry-run"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection": ">=0.2.0-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-settings": ">=0.2.0-rc.1"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-session-controller",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-workspace-controller"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dshReleases": {
        "0.2.0-rc.2": "compatible",
        "0.2.1-rc.2": "compatible"
      }
    }
  }
}
